The '''Veragi Trade Route''' was a long and winding [[hyperspace route]] that stretched through the [[New Territories]] portion of the [[Outer Rim Territories]]. It ran through the [[Dantooine system|star system]] of the [[planet]] [[Dantooine]].<ref name="BMF 37" /> The world of [[Salin/Canon|Salin]] was also located along the Veragi Trade Route, where it connected with the [[Salin Corridor]] trade route. Furthermore, the [[Braxant Run]] hyperspace route was also connected to the Veragi Trade Route.<ref name="Scarif Outer Rim" />

